sequenceDiagram
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Reconciler as WorkbenchesReconciler<br/>controller-runtime
    participant FS as /opt/manifests<br/>Local Filesystem
    participant Krusty as Krusty Engine<br/>Kustomize Renderer
    participant HWWH as Hardware Profile Webhook<br/>9443/TCP HTTPS
    participant ConnWH as Connection Webhook<br/>9443/TCP HTTPS
    participant WebhookSvc as Webhook Service<br/>443/TCP → 9443

    Note over K8sAPI,Reconciler: Flow 1: Workbenches CR Reconciliation

    K8sAPI->>Reconciler: Watch event: Workbenches CR changed<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    Reconciler->>FS: Read baked manifests<br/>(hermetic, no network)
    FS-->>Reconciler: Raw Kustomize manifests
    Reconciler->>Krusty: Render with overlays<br/>(platform, images, params)
    Krusty-->>Reconciler: Rendered resources
    Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Server-Side Apply (SSA)<br/>Field Manager: workbenches-operator
    K8sAPI-->>Reconciler: Applied resources
    Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Update Workbenches/status<br/>(phase: Pending → Ready)
    K8sAPI-->>Reconciler: Status confirmed

    Note over K8sAPI,HWWH: Flow 2: Notebook Admission (Hardware Profile)

    K8sAPI->>WebhookSvc: POST /workbenches-hardware-profile<br/>Notebook CREATE/UPDATE<br/>TLS (auto-detected)
    WebhookSvc->>HWWH: Forward to :9443
    HWWH->>K8sAPI: GET HardwareProfile CR<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
    K8sAPI-->>HWWH: HardwareProfile spec
    HWWH->>HWWH: Mutate: inject resources,<br/>nodeSelector, tolerations,<br/>Kueue queue label
    HWWH->>K8sAPI: Create Event<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
    HWWH-->>WebhookSvc: Admission Response (patches)
    WebhookSvc-->>K8sAPI: Mutated Notebook

    Note over K8sAPI,ConnWH: Flow 3: Notebook Admission (Connection Injection)

    K8sAPI->>WebhookSvc: POST /workbenches-connection-notebook<br/>Notebook CREATE/UPDATE<br/>TLS (auto-detected)
    WebhookSvc->>ConnWH: Forward to :9443
    ConnWH->>K8sAPI: GET Secrets (connection data)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
    K8sAPI-->>ConnWH: Connection secrets
    ConnWH->>K8sAPI: SubjectAccessReview<br/>(validate user access)
    K8sAPI-->>ConnWH: Access granted
    ConnWH->>ConnWH: Mutate: inject envFrom<br/>for connection secrets
    ConnWH-->>WebhookSvc: Admission Response (patches)
    WebhookSvc-->>K8sAPI: Mutated Notebook
